WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:35.900 --> 01:38.950
Unit 01's interlocking circuits have been cut.

01:38.950 --> 01:40.450
What about the force eject signal?

01:40.450 --> 01:43.620
It's being blocked from the plug side.
It's not being accepted.

01:44.040 --> 01:47.420
But, Shinji, if we hadn't done that,
you would have been killed.

01:47.420 --> 01:48.790
That doesn't matter.

01:48.790 --> 01:50.790
But it is a fact.

01:50.790 --> 01:53.760
Don't make me more angry
by saying things like that.

01:53.760 --> 01:56.550
Unit 01 has 185 seconds of power
left in its reserves.

01:56.550 --> 01:59.640
That's enough to destroy at least
half of Headquarters.

01:59.640 --> 02:01.640
The way he is right now, he'll do it too.

02:01.640 --> 02:03.680
Shinji, listen to us!

02:03.680 --> 02:05.560
If Commander Ikari hadn't made that decision,

02:05.560 --> 02:07.390
everyone could have been killed!

02:07.390 --> 02:09.940
I said that doesn't matter!

02:09.940 --> 02:11.110
My father...

02:11.110 --> 02:14.650
That bastard tried to kill Toji!

02:14.650 --> 02:15.900
With my hands...

02:15.940 --> 02:17.860
EPISODE 19
A MAN'S BATTLE

02:18.280 --> 02:22.580
Father, you're there, aren't you?
Say something! Answer me!

02:22.580 --> 02:25.200
Increase the pressure of the LCL to maximum.

02:25.950 --> 02:28.370
We have no time to waste on a childish tantrum.

02:29.250 --> 02:31.380
I've still got a direct control circuit...

02:33.800 --> 02:36.210
Damn! Damn!

02:37.260 --> 02:38.970
Damn...

02:39.970 --> 02:42.390
The right breast has been completely dissolved.

02:42.390 --> 02:45.470
We'll begin cleansing the bodily fluids
from Unit 03 on schedule.

02:47.310 --> 02:48.390
Have you recovered?

02:48.390 --> 02:51.060
As long as I can work, it's not a problem.

02:51.060 --> 02:53.860
I couldn't just lie in bed during
an emergency like this.

02:56.110 --> 02:57.780
So what happened to Shinji?

02:57.780 --> 03:00.570
I understand that they opened the
escape hatch with a laser cutter,

03:00.570 --> 03:02.490
and removed him forcibly.

03:02.490 --> 03:04.330
That's just wonderful.

03:04.330 --> 03:04.990
This time...

03:04.990 --> 03:06.700
It might really be over.

03:07.250 --> 03:10.040
I'll bet that idiot won't recover from this.

03:10.580 --> 03:12.170
How is Ikari?

03:12.170 --> 03:15.380
He wasn't injured, so he ought to be okay.

03:15.380 --> 03:17.210
He's probably dreaming away.

03:18.050 --> 03:18.840
Dreaming?

03:18.840 --> 03:21.930
Yeah. Don't tell me you don't dream?

03:33.230 --> 03:34.650
Shinji...

03:35.230 --> 03:37.820
Why's he lyin' here next to me?

03:39.150 --> 03:41.450
Where am I?

03:41.900 --> 03:43.740
In the same hospital as my sister?

04:00.010 --> 04:03.300
Hey, isn't that Shinji and Ayanami?

04:03.300 --> 04:06.220
Ikari, why did you do that?

04:06.220 --> 04:08.430
Because I couldn't forgive my father.

04:09.180 --> 04:10.980
He betrayed me.

04:11.810 --> 04:14.850
I was finally able to have a comfortable
conversation with my father,

04:15.350 --> 04:19.110
but he won't try to understand my feelings at all!

04:19.110 --> 04:22.400
Did you try to understand your father's feelings?

04:22.650 --> 04:24.200
I tried.

04:24.200 --> 04:25.870
Why don't you try to understand him?

04:25.870 --> 04:27.530
I said I tried!

04:27.530 --> 04:30.370
And that's how you run away
from unpleasantness.

04:30.370 --> 04:31.870
What's wrong with that?!

04:31.870 --> 04:35.000
What's wrong with running away
from unpleasantness?!

04:36.750 --> 04:40.130
What are those two arguin' about?

04:42.550 --> 04:45.050
We're making a special exception for you.
Just for five minutes.

04:45.050 --> 04:46.970
I understand. Thank you very much.

04:53.850 --> 04:55.900
If it isn't the Class Rep...

04:55.900 --> 04:57.980
Suzuhara, are you okay?

04:58.400 --> 05:01.030
Well, looks like I'm still alive.

05:05.200 --> 05:10.030
What the heck? I thought Shinji was here.
Was I just dreamin'?

05:10.030 --> 05:13.040
I heard Ikari was discharged yesterday.

05:13.040 --> 05:15.330
You've slept for three days, Suzuhara.

05:16.170 --> 05:19.000
I did? For three whole days?

05:20.420 --> 05:22.130
Class Rep, did you...

05:22.130 --> 05:25.380
I came here as part of my duties
as the class representative!

05:25.380 --> 05:27.390
There isn't anything else to it!

05:28.180 --> 05:30.810
Yeah, I know that.

05:30.810 --> 05:32.390
You don't know anything.

05:33.310 --> 05:36.890
Sorry that I didn't get to eat
the lunch you made.

05:38.100 --> 05:39.810
Don't worry about it.

05:40.230 --> 05:44.740
But I'm sorry. They won't let me
bring you lunch here.

05:46.280 --> 05:48.030
Class Rep?

05:48.030 --> 05:48.990
What?

05:48.990 --> 05:51.280
Would you do me a favor?

05:52.450 --> 05:56.500
Would you tell my sister that there's
nothin' wrong with me?

05:59.380 --> 06:03.590
Get out, Shinji Ikari.
The Commander wants to see you.

06:05.340 --> 06:08.680
Disobeying orders, private
appropriation of an Eva,

06:08.680 --> 06:10.510
blatant intimidation...

06:10.510 --> 06:12.720
These are all criminal offenses.

06:13.390 --> 06:15.470
Do you have anything to say?

06:16.430 --> 06:20.270
Yes, I don't want to pilot an Eva anymore.

06:20.270 --> 06:22.320
I don't want to stay here either.

06:22.320 --> 06:23.900
Then leave.

06:23.900 --> 06:27.360
Yes. I'll go back to my teacher's place.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.870
So you're running away again?

06:31.820 --> 06:35.410
You disappoint me.
I doubt we'll ever meet again.

06:35.410 --> 06:37.410
Yes, that's my intent.

06:46.760 --> 06:48.220
It's me.

06:48.220 --> 06:50.380
Erase the Third Child.

06:50.380 --> 06:53.720
Rei will be Unit 01's designated pilot,

06:53.720 --> 06:55.720
with the dummy plug as backup.

07:28.170 --> 07:29.720
Are you there, Shinji?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.760
Is it true that you're leaving?

07:32.800 --> 07:34.510
It's true, isn't it?

07:34.510 --> 07:37.640
But why? Why are you running away now?

07:39.180 --> 07:41.770
I wanted to be like you.

07:42.060 --> 07:45.400
I envied you. You're different from us.

07:46.270 --> 07:50.700
Damn! Even Toji became an Eva pilot, while I...

07:52.490 --> 07:54.620
This line is monitored.

07:54.620 --> 07:57.620
For security reasons, we have
terminated this call.

07:57.620 --> 07:59.410
We appreciate your cooperation.

08:03.580 --> 08:06.040
I'm sure that Asuka is so disgusted with me,
she's not coming.

08:06.040 --> 08:09.090
Yes, she didn't even ask me
to say goodbye to you.

08:09.090 --> 08:11.920
That sounds like her. I'm relieved.

08:11.920 --> 08:15.510
If you keep cutting your ties like this,
you'll have a tough life ahead of you.

08:15.510 --> 08:19.140
That's your philosophy, Miss Misato.
I can't live like you.

08:19.640 --> 08:21.180
As I'm sure you know,

08:21.180 --> 08:24.850
there will be quite a few restrictions
placed on your activities.

08:25.350 --> 08:27.020
Yes.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.440
But...

08:28.440 --> 08:29.480
What?

08:29.480 --> 08:31.280
Please tell me one thing.

08:31.740 --> 08:34.360
Why was Toji chosen to be the Fourth Child?

08:34.700 --> 08:38.870
All the fourth-level candidates
were in your class.

08:39.370 --> 08:44.080
I just found out myself recently
that it was all set up.

08:44.080 --> 08:45.620
All of them?

08:45.620 --> 08:47.000
All of my classmates...

08:47.000 --> 08:51.260
What happened with Suzuhara was a mistake
that can't be mended with words alone.

08:51.670 --> 08:54.180
But, Shinji, to be honest,

08:54.180 --> 08:58.350
I was projecting all of my dreams,
hopes and purpose onto you.

08:58.350 --> 09:01.270
I also know that it's been a huge burden for you.

09:01.270 --> 09:03.850
But we, everyone at Nerv,

09:03.850 --> 09:06.100
had no choice except to entrust
our future to you.

09:06.600 --> 09:09.020
I want you to remember that one thing.

09:09.020 --> 09:10.940
That's a selfish excuse, isn't it?

09:10.940 --> 09:13.070
I know it is.

09:13.070 --> 09:16.990
I'll leave your pass code to HQ
and your room as they are.

09:16.990 --> 09:19.580
There's no point. Get rid of them, please.

09:20.330 --> 09:22.750
I won't pilot an Eva again.

09:24.120 --> 09:26.420
He's speaking aggressively.

09:26.960 --> 09:28.210
I've never heard him like that.

09:37.680 --> 09:42.470
Government Only Special Express R-13
Departing 13:38 to New Atsugi

09:37.930 --> 09:42.970
A special state of emergency has been declared
for the Tokai region.

09:42.560 --> 09:44.100
Evacuation Route

09:42.970 --> 09:47.350
All residents, please evacuate to your
designated shelters immediately.

09:47.350 --> 09:48.730
Repeating...

09:48.730 --> 09:49.400
An Angel!

09:54.740 --> 09:56.950
All personnel, battle stations, Level One.

09:56.950 --> 09:58.820
Prepare for ground-to-air intercept.

09:58.820 --> 09:59.780
Target status?

09:59.780 --> 10:01.410
It's currently advancing.

10:01.410 --> 10:03.160
The Komagatake Defense Line
has been penetrated.

10:12.130 --> 10:14.760
Armor layers one through eighteen
have been breached!

10:14.760 --> 10:17.220
Eighteen layers of special armor at once?!

10:18.510 --> 10:20.890
The Eva won't make it there in time
for a ground level intercept.

10:20.890 --> 10:22.810
Position Unit 02 for combat
inside the Geo-Front,

10:22.810 --> 10:24.270
directly in front of Headquarters.

10:26.180 --> 10:30.350
Asuka will engage the target as soon
as it breaches the Geo-Front.

10:30.350 --> 10:31.690
What about Unit 00?

10:31.690 --> 10:34.320
It's been placed in the AT Field
Neutralization Zone.

10:34.320 --> 10:36.360
However, the left arm hasn't been
regenerated yet.

10:36.360 --> 10:37.700
Then it can't engage in combat.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.200
Sortie Rei in Unit 01.

10:40.280 --> 10:42.620
Prepare a dummy plug as the backup system.

10:42.620 --> 10:43.120
Yes, Sir.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.580
Start entry.

10:45.580 --> 10:46.910
LCL electrolyzed.

10:46.910 --> 10:48.830
Commence A10 nerve connection.

10:53.420 --> 10:55.460
So it's not going to work anymore.

10:55.460 --> 10:56.550
Pulse flow is reversing!

10:56.550 --> 10:59.340
Unit 01 is rejecting the neural connections!

10:59.340 --> 11:01.180
No, that can't be possible!

11:01.180 --> 11:02.340
Ikari?

11:02.340 --> 11:04.930
Yes, it's rejecting me.

11:07.520 --> 11:10.980
Abort activation. Sortie Rei in Unit 00.

11:10.980 --> 11:13.190
Re-activate Unit 01 with the dummy plug.

11:13.190 --> 11:14.480
But Unit 00 isn't...

11:14.480 --> 11:16.480
It doesn't matter. I'll go.

11:16.480 --> 11:17.530
Rei?

11:17.530 --> 11:19.610
Even if I die, I can be replaced.

11:23.490 --> 11:27.240
I... I decided I'd never pilot it again.

11:27.240 --> 11:30.500
Hey, you! What're you doing?
Get into the shelter, quickly.

11:30.960 --> 11:31.960
It's no use!

11:31.960 --> 11:34.840
One more hit, and all the armor layers
will have been breached!

11:35.290 --> 11:37.090
I'm counting on you, Asuka.

11:40.930 --> 11:42.430
Here it comes.

11:42.430 --> 11:46.430
Even if Shinji isn't here, I can do this by myself.
Piece of cake!

11:53.230 --> 11:54.650
Bastard!

12:00.690 --> 12:01.950
Darn. Next!

12:06.530 --> 12:09.120
I'm neutralizing its AT Field, aren't I?

12:11.040 --> 12:12.580
Why won't it go down?!

12:16.380 --> 12:18.840
I can't lose ever again!

12:26.800 --> 12:27.300
No way!

12:38.190 --> 12:41.150
You damn bastard!

12:41.150 --> 12:42.240
Asuka!

12:42.240 --> 12:43.950
Cut all the nerve connections now!

12:49.490 --> 12:52.830
Evacuation training? What are you, stupid?

12:52.830 --> 12:55.830
That stuff's got nothing to do with us pilots.

13:02.300 --> 13:03.920
Direct hit on the Eighth District!

13:04.840 --> 13:08.180
Abandon the Sixth Shelter! All survivors,
hurry to the Third Shelter!

13:08.180 --> 13:10.180
Unit 02 is severely damaged!
It can't continue combat.

13:10.180 --> 13:11.060
How's Asuka?

13:11.060 --> 13:12.600
She's safe. Alive!

13:15.100 --> 13:16.520
Damn...

13:16.520 --> 13:18.480
The Angel has started moving.

13:18.480 --> 13:19.650
What's Unit 01's status?

13:21.400 --> 13:23.030
Dummy plug upload, complete.

13:23.030 --> 13:24.700
Probe insertion, complete.

13:24.700 --> 13:26.240
Start contact.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.490
Roger!

13:27.490 --> 13:28.620
What?

13:28.620 --> 13:31.040
The pulses have vanished.
It's rejecting the dummy plug.

13:31.040 --> 13:33.580
It's no use! Eva Unit 01 won't activate!

13:35.120 --> 13:36.830
The dummy, Rei...

13:36.830 --> 13:38.830
It won't accept them?

13:38.830 --> 13:40.540
Fuyutsuki...

13:40.540 --> 13:42.210
I'm leaving you in charge for a bit.

13:42.210 --> 13:46.430
Number two and number four will be blocked off.

13:42.210 --> 13:46.430
Please evacuate immediately.

13:42.710 --> 13:44.210
Take casualties to the Sixth Block.

13:44.210 --> 13:46.680
Hurry the uninjured to the Third Shelter!

13:47.930 --> 13:48.800
This way!

13:48.800 --> 13:49.430
Hurry!

13:49.470 --> 13:50.390
Quickly!

13:50.390 --> 13:51.220
Hurry!

13:51.220 --> 13:53.890
Hey, you! What're you doing?
Do you want to die?!

13:55.350 --> 13:56.690
Asuka...

13:57.390 --> 13:58.940
Well, if it isn't Shinji.

13:59.980 --> 14:01.190
Mr. Kaji?

14:02.480 --> 14:04.690
What are you doing here?

14:04.740 --> 14:06.700
That's my line.

14:06.700 --> 14:08.450
What are you doing here, Shinji?

14:09.200 --> 14:10.990
I...

14:10.990 --> 14:13.330
I'm never going to pilot an Eva again.

14:13.910 --> 14:15.450
And since I decided that...

14:16.250 --> 14:18.080
I see.

14:18.210 --> 14:22.670
Well, since my moonlighting came out into
the open, I'm not welcome on the combat roster.

14:22.670 --> 14:24.670
So, here I am, watering the plants.

14:24.670 --> 14:26.260
At a time like this?

14:26.260 --> 14:27.760
It's because it's a time like this.

14:28.180 --> 14:30.590
Between Katsuragi's breasts is nice too,

14:30.590 --> 14:33.100
but in the end, I want to be here when I die.

14:33.100 --> 14:34.100
Die?

14:37.850 --> 14:39.140
That's right.

14:39.140 --> 14:41.940
It's said if an Angel makes contact
with Adam, who lies below here,

14:41.940 --> 14:45.940
humanity will be eradicated in the Third Impact.

14:45.940 --> 14:47.360
The only thing that can stop it

14:47.360 --> 14:50.450
is the one thing with power equal
to an Angel's, the Evangelion.

14:53.080 --> 14:54.540
Ayanami?

14:54.540 --> 14:55.660
Without even a rifle?!

14:59.080 --> 15:00.080
Does she mean to blow herself up?!

15:00.080 --> 15:00.540
Rei!

15:04.920 --> 15:06.300
AT Field, full power.

15:20.140 --> 15:21.060
What happened to Unit 00?

15:25.020 --> 15:25.520
Rei!

15:26.820 --> 15:27.860
What has she done?

15:30.280 --> 15:33.820
Shinji, the only thing I can do
is stand here and water.

15:34.620 --> 15:38.580
But you, you have something that you can do.
That only you can do.

15:40.160 --> 15:42.080
Nobody is forcing you.

15:42.080 --> 15:44.460
Think for yourself, and make
the decision by yourself.

15:44.460 --> 15:46.590
Think about what you ought to do now.

15:47.460 --> 15:50.130
You know, so you don't have any regrets.

16:05.310 --> 16:07.400
Direct hit on the third foundation.

16:07.400 --> 16:09.360
The final armor plate has melted!

16:09.360 --> 16:12.200
Damn! The Main Shaft is completely exposed!

16:12.200 --> 16:13.860
Isn't Unit 01 ready yet?

16:13.860 --> 16:15.450
It's rejecting the dummy plug.

16:16.030 --> 16:18.120
It failed! No response detected!

16:18.120 --> 16:21.460
Keep trying. Repeat the process from step 108.

16:21.460 --> 16:22.920
Let me pilot it!

16:23.460 --> 16:25.540
I... I...

16:26.750 --> 16:28.960
Let me pilot Unit 01, please!

16:31.050 --> 16:32.130
Father...

16:35.050 --> 16:36.800
Why are you here?

16:43.640 --> 16:45.480
I... I...

16:45.480 --> 16:47.770
I am the pilot of Evangelion Unit 01!

16:47.770 --> 16:49.860
Shinji Ikari!

16:52.400 --> 16:54.780
The target has invaded the Main Shaft!

16:54.780 --> 16:56.200
It's descending!

16:56.200 --> 16:57.160
Where is it heading?

16:57.160 --> 16:59.580
It's advancing directly towards Central Dogma.

16:59.580 --> 17:00.790
It's coming here.

17:00.790 --> 17:02.330
All personnel evacuate. Hurry!

17:02.330 --> 17:05.000
All personnel evacuate!
Repeat, all personnel evacuate!

17:18.350 --> 17:19.350
Eva Unit 01?!

17:20.260 --> 17:21.060
Shinji!

17:45.540 --> 17:46.370
Miss Misato!

17:46.370 --> 17:47.960
Launch number five! Hurry!

18:16.070 --> 18:18.070
Out of energy?

18:18.070 --> 18:19.780
Unit 01 has reached its activation limit.

18:19.780 --> 18:21.070
The backup isn't working either!

18:21.070 --> 18:21.780
Shinji!

18:30.420 --> 18:31.170
Shinji!

18:31.960 --> 18:35.630
Move! Move! Move! Move! Come on, move!

18:35.630 --> 18:37.760
There isn't any point to this
if you don't move now!

18:50.810 --> 18:51.690
That's...

19:04.910 --> 19:07.080
Move! Move! Move!

19:07.080 --> 19:10.870
Move! Move! Move! Move! Move! Move!

19:10.870 --> 19:13.880
Move! Move! Come on, move!

19:13.880 --> 19:17.550
If you don't move now, if you don't do it now,
everyone's going to die!

19:17.550 --> 19:20.590
I don't want any more of that! So...

19:20.590 --> 19:21.680
PLEASE MOVE!

19:47.540 --> 19:49.330
Eva has re-activated!

19:58.960 --> 20:00.630
Incredible!

20:00.630 --> 20:06.510
No way, this is unbelievable.
Unit 01's synch rate is over 400%!

20:06.510 --> 20:09.100
Does that mean she's really awakened?

20:51.600 --> 20:53.600
It's eating the Angel?

20:58.650 --> 21:03.820
Eva Unit 01 is taking the S2 engine into herself?

21:24.550 --> 21:25.930
The bindings!

21:25.930 --> 21:27.140
Bindings?

21:27.140 --> 21:30.060
That's right. That's not armor plating.

21:30.060 --> 21:34.020
Those are restraints that allow us
to suppress the Eva's true power.

21:34.020 --> 21:37.400
And now those bindings are being undone
by the Eva's own might.

21:37.400 --> 21:40.520
We can no longer stop the Eva.

21:41.190 --> 21:43.990
Unit 01's been awakened and set free.

21:43.990 --> 21:46.280
Seele won't stay quiet for this.

21:46.280 --> 21:49.070
Was this also part of your script,
Commander Ikari?

21:50.200 --> 21:51.790
It's begun, hasn't it?

21:51.790 --> 21:54.450
Yes, it all begins here.

21:57.870 --> 22:00.380
TO BE CONTINUED

23:05.900 --> 23:06.860
PREVIEW

23:06.480 --> 23:09.030
Mankind has been saved
by the Eva's awakening,

23:09.030 --> 23:12.570
but Shinji is taken into Unit 01
and merges with it physically.

23:12.570 --> 23:16.540
They try to salvage him, but fail.
What was it that the crying Misato saw?

23:16.540 --> 23:19.330
Next time: "Form of the Mind,
Form of the Man"

23:17.700 --> 23:20.920
FORM OF THE MIND, FORM OF THE MAN
